{"comment":"The consent and the start of an app. The test writes the fixture app to ${home}/.air/apps/fixture.yaml first, and its consent store is empty. The IDE reports what the user does as intents of the apps channel. The step appStart {command} expects air-ide to start the process, and the lines of the link app are then its stdin and stdout."}
